Amber — Jurassic World Alive 3.22 DNA calculator
Copyright 2026 neomikr0n

This repository contains source code that is entirely original, plus game data
derived from a third-party source. It does not contain third-party artwork.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. GAME DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/jwa-3.22.json holds the creature data the calculator works from: stats,
fusion ingredients, DNA and coin costs, and darting zones. That data describes
the mechanics of Jurassic World Alive and was extracted from the community site
paleo.gg, which the application itself credits on screen.

It is included so the calculator works offline and out of the box. The Apache
License 2.0 in LICENSE covers the source code of this repository. It does not
extend to this data, which is reproduced here as factual game information with
its source credited.

