--------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. ARTWORK IS NOT DISTRIBUTED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application can show a photo for each creature. Those images are not part
of this repository: they are copyrighted material belonging to the game, they
are listed in .gitignore, and anyone who wants them downloads them locally with

    python3 descargar_imagenes.py

The deployed site therefore shows no creature photos. Nothing breaks without
them: each image carries an onerror handler that hides it, and the layout falls
back to names and figures.

The twelve small interface icons under img/stat, img/res and img/cat are
included, because the interface does not degrade gracefully without them.

The favicon is an original drawing made for this project. It is deliberately
not the Jurassic Park logo, which is a registered trademark.
